meta {
  name: Submit Application (Student)
  type: http
  seq: 17
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/student/application-forms/{{admissionCycleId}}/application/submit
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Final submit — the only point where seats are actually decremented
  (course+quota selection only checks availability, never reserves).
  Requires: application still in "draft" status, declaration accepted, and
  at least one active course selection. Runs atomically inside a single DB
  transaction: for each selected course+quota, conditionally decrements the
  seat count (courseQuotaSeats.openSeats or, if pooled, seatPools.openSeats)
  only if openSeats > 0 at that instant — if any selection lost the race for
  the last seat, the whole submit rolls back with 409 so the student can
  revisit their course selections rather than being left half-submitted.
  On success: Application.formStatus -> "submitted", each ApplicationCourse
  status -> "submitted" with a status log entry, submittedAt is set.
}
